@startuml "Student Notifications Feedback Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam sequenceMessageSize 22
actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "StudentController" as SC
database "CSDL" as DB

Student -> FE: Xem thông báo
FE -> SC: GET /api/student/notifications
SC -> DB: SELECT notifications
DB --> SC: data
SC --> FE: 200 OK

Student -> FE: Xem phản ánh đã gửi
FE -> SC: GET /api/student/feedbacks
SC -> DB: SELECT feedbacks
DB --> SC: data
SC --> FE: 200 OK
@enduml
